{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the Wild</strong> is an educational game where you play as real forest animals, roam a beautiful island, and collect fact orbs to learn real-world facts about the animals you control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575380/extras/adfe8060820deba825d8f87941148105.avif?t=1749108021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575380/extras_big/adfe8060820deba825d8f87941148105.avif?t=1749108021 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn Through Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has its own set of unique facts scattered across the island.  <br>Find them, collect them, and our in-game guide will display the fact and read it aloud to you - teaching you something new with every discovery.  <br> <br>With hundreds of facts scattered across the island, there's plenty to explore and learn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the atmosphere of the island with our custom soundtrack, composed by WesWolf Productions to perfectly complement the game's beautiful environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Time &amp; Weather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our dynamic time and weather system enables an additional layer of interaction with the world. As a player, you can choose to use real-world time (relative to their time-zone) or our in-game time.\u00a0<br><br>Want clear skies all the time? You also have the ability to disable weather entirely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you play is completely up to you.   <br><br>Escape into nature and enjoy your time <strong>In the Wild</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575380/extras/f6a44e48702171fb354e4b2e7cbc1b14.avif?t=1749108021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575380/extras_big/f6a44e48702171fb354e4b2e7cbc1b14.avif?t=1749108021 width=800 height=448 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1575380/b7fde3416b18cbbc23d0c624c89c0929832e1586.jpg"},{"name":"The Bear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1575380/67076150fa7dd5a192b49807e112a17ca001d4ad.jpg"},{"name":"The Deer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1575380/adeb9ce7008c502cb60c1c9e8ece1f2486de3dc0.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the Wild","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1575380/fd429c65f58e96f380b2d91ef17bc6d0602e7999.jpg"},{"name":"The Boar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1575380/96e4d9d763fdda3ac52affb34b844852cf988557.jpg"},{"name":"The Rabbit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1575380/f7486eb5c7c60615575ac5318258e00684d65709.jpg"},{"name":"The Fact Checker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1575380/f22aef25da9283c59c086870f0ad7945c68997a1.jpg"},{"name":"The Zoologist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1575380/66ca312dd982e19957ab81392ac96fc09b28e68d.jpg"},{"name":"The Fox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1575380/290715af158d0f31ca1772a13dc76ab4aca329fc.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1575380?t=1749108021","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1575380?t=1749108021","capsule_